      "value": "Hi @{66bb3de80d4785ab72493aa8|full_name}! Thank you for your request.\n\nThe VCC allows you to create user templates, which make it easy to quickly create multiple projects that use the same packages.\n\nhttps://vcc.docs.vrchat.com/vpm/templates#user-templates\n\nIs this the type of feature you were looking for? Or is there something else you would need?",
