  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "An ability to create custom project templates with user packages automatically added to the project, rather than having to add them each time a project is created.\n\nSome packages are used very frequently between peoples projects and it would be quite nice to be able to create custom templates, to help streamline the process.\n\nThanks!",
